{"unit_id": "tag:0075:statement", "translation": "考虑拓扑空间（topological spaces）的范畴（category）<MATH_0001>。存在一个自然的忠实（faithful）函子（functor）<MATH_0002>，它与积（products）和等化子（equalizers）交换（commutes）。但它不反映同构（isomorphisms）。事实上，引理<REF_0001>的类似结论不成立。\n具体来说，设<MATH_0003>带有离散（discrete）拓扑（topology）。令<MATH_0004>（对<MATH_0005>）为离散（discrete）拓扑空间（topological space）。对任意子集（subset）<MATH_0006>，定义<MATH_0007>并赋予离散（discrete）拓扑（topology）。这样便得到一个拓扑空间（topological spaces）的预层（presheaf），其底层的集合（sets）预层（presheaf）是一个层（sheaf），见例<REF_0002>。\n然而，若每个<MATH_0008>都至少有两个元素（elements），则这不是定义<REF_0003>所说的拓扑空间（topological spaces）的层（sheaf）。读者可验证，赋予<TEXTITOPEN_0001>积（product）拓扑（topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>给每个<MATH_0009>确实会得到<MATH_0010>上的拓扑空间（topological spaces）的层（sheaf）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "equalizers", "target_term": "等化子"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "subset", "target_term": "子集"}, {"source_term": "discrete", "target_term": "离散"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "topological spaces", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "product", "target_term"