{"unit_id": "tag:0077:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的一个环层（sheaf of rings）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是一个<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0006>，见定义<REF_0001>，其底层的阿贝尔群（abelian groups）预层（presheaf）<MATH_0007>是一个层（sheaf）。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002><MATH_0008>-模（modules）的层态射（morphism of sheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是<MATH_0009>-模（modules）的预层（presheaves）之间的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 给定<MATH_0010>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>，以<MATH_0013>表示<MATH_0014>-模（modules）的层态射（morphism of sheaves）组成的集合（set）。\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0015>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category）记作<MATH_0016>。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism of sheaves", "target_term": "层态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "morphism of sheaves", "target_term": "层态射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "con