{"unit_id": "tag:0076:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n即使<MATH_0001>只是一个环（rings）的预层（presheaf），这个定义也多少说得通，尽管我们不知道有什么例子能用到这一点。我们会避免在“<MATH_0002>-模（modules）的层（sheaves）”这一用语中让<MATH_0003>为环层（sheaf of rings）以外的对象。\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "指定此处预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指一般化情形下的标量对象"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "属于作者讨论用法的术语"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "属于作者讨论用法的术语"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层", "context": "指作者限定术语用法时所要求的标量对象类型"}], "notes": []}
