{"unit_id": "tag:0078:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个点（point）。设<MATH_0003>是一个集合（sets）的预层（presheaf），定义在<MATH_0004>上。<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>处的茎（stalk）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是集合（set）\n<MATH_0007>\n其中余极限（colimit）取遍由<MATH_0008>（<MATH_0009>在<MATH_0010>中的开邻域（open neighbourhoods））组成的集合（set）。开邻域（open neighbourhoods）的集合（set）按（反向）包含关系（inclusion）赋予偏序（partially ordered），即规定<MATH_0011>。该系统（system）中的过渡映射（transition maps）由<MATH_0012>的限制映射（maps）给出。关于系统（systems）的（余）极限（limits）的记号和术语，见范畴（Categories）章第<REF_0001>节。\n注意，此余极限（colimit）是有向余极限（directed colimit）。因此很容易描述<MATH_0013>。具体来说，\n<MATH_0014>\n其等价关系（equivalence relation）规定为：<MATH_0015>当且仅当存在开集（open）<MATH_0016>，使得<MATH_0017>且<MATH_0018>。给定一个二元组（pair）<MATH_0019>，我们有时以<MATH_0020>记<MATH_0021>中对应于<MATH_0022>的等价类（equivalence class）的那个元素（element）。我们有时用“<MATH_0023>在<MATH_0024>中的像（image）”这一说法来指<MATH_0025>。例如，给定两个二元组（pairs）<MATH_0026>和<MATH_0027>，我们有时说“<MATH_0028>等于<MATH_0029>，等式在<MATH_0030>中成立”，以表示<MATH_0031>。其他作者使用“<MATH_0032>在<MATH_0033>处的芽（germ）”这一术语。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n由此定义可直接得出，对任意开集（open）<MATH_0034>，存在典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0035>\n由<MATH_0036>定义。请想一想！\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "colimit", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "inclusion", "target_term": "包含关系"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered", "target_term": "偏序"}, {"source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "t