{"unit_id": "tag:007F:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的预层（presheaf），定义在<MATH_0003>上。<MATH_0004>上存在唯一的阿贝尔群（abelian group）结构，使得对每个开集（open）<MATH_0005>，若<MATH_0006>，则映射（map）<MATH_0007>是群（group）同态（homomorphism）。此外，\n<MATH_0008>\n在阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的范畴（category）中成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指引理的底空间"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指取茎所用的对象"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指茎上存在唯一的代数结构类型"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指保持群结构的条件所涉及的开集"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指断言为群同态的映射"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群", "context": "指该同态所保持的代数结构"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态", "context": "指所述映射须满足的性质"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指余极限等式所在范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指出余极限等式成立的范畴"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:007F:proof", "translation": "我们把一对元素（elements）<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>的和（addition）定义为二元组（pair）<MATH_0003>。其余部分容易验证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "和"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "指相加运算的两个输入"}, {"source_term": "addition", "target_term": "和", "context": "指由该二元组给出的相加结果"}, {"source_term": "pair", "target_term": "二元组", "context": "指用来表示相加结果的二元组"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:007E:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n上述证明的关键在于，开邻域（open neighbourhoods）所成的偏序集（partially ordered set）是有向集（directed set）（见范畴（Categories）章的定义<REF_0001>）。具体来说，两个阿贝尔群（abelian groups）<MATH_0001>的余积（coproduct）是直和（direct sum）<MATH_0002>，而集合（sets）的范畴（category）中的余积（coproduct）是不交并（disjoint union）<MATH_0003>。这表明，阿贝尔群（abelian groups）的范畴（category）中的余极限（colimits）一般与集合（sets）的范畴（category）中的余极限（colimits）不一致。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered set", "target_term": "偏序集"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "coproduct", "target_term": "余积"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "coproduct", "target_term": "余积"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "open neighbourhoods", "target_term": "开邻域", "context": "指为茎的余极限提供指标的开邻域"}, {"source_term": "partially ordered set", "target_term": "偏序集", "context": "指按反向包含关系排序的开邻域集合"}, {"source_term": "directed set", "target_term": "有向集", "context": "指该偏序集具有的性质"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指所引用定义所在的章"}, {"source_term": "abelian groups", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指取余积的两个对象"}, {"source_term": "coproduct", "target_term": "余积", "context": "指这两个阿贝尔群的余积"}, {"source_term": "direct sum", "target_term": "直和", "context": "给出这两个阿贝尔群的余积"}, {"source_term": 