{"unit_id": "tag:007G:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n对任一类代数结构（algebraic structure），只要有向（directed）余极限（colimits）与遗忘（forgetful）函子（functor）交换（commute），引理<REF_0001>的证明就适用。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "forgetful", "target_term": "遗忘"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic structure", "target_term": "代数结构", "context": "指前述证明所适用的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向", "context": "限定所涉及的余极限"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "指须与遗忘函子交换的构造"}, {"source_term": "forgetful", "target_term": "遗忘", "context": "指把代数结构送到其底层数据的函子类型"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指交换条件所涉及的遗忘函子"}, {"source_term": "commute", "target_term": "交换", "context": "指该函子与有向余极限须满足的关系"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:007H:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个范畴（category）。设<MATH_0002>是一个函子（functor）。假设\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0003>是忠实的（faithful），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 有向（directed）余极限（colimits）在<MATH_0004>中存在，且<MATH_0005>与它们交换（commutes）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n设<MATH_0006>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0007>。设<MATH_0008>是一个取值于<MATH_0009>的预层（presheaf）。则\n<MATH_0010>\n在<MATH_0011>中存在。其底层集合（set）等于<MATH_0012>的底层集合（sets）预层（presheaf）的茎（stalk）。此外，构造<MATH_0013>给出一个从取值于<MATH_0014>的预层（presheaves）所成的范畴（category）到<MATH_0015>的函子（functor）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指代数结构的取值范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指满足两项假设的函子"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的", "context": "指该函子的第一项假设"}, {"source_term": "directed", "target_term": "有向", "context": "限定第二项假设中涉及的余极限"}, {"source_term": "colimits", "target_term": "余极限", "context": "指假设在该范畴中存在的构造"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "交换", "context": "指该函子与这些余极限须满足的关系"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指预层的底空间"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指取值于给定范畴的输入对象"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指所构造对象的底层集合"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指输入对象的底层预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指输入对象所对应的底层集合预层"}, {"source_term": "stalk", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指底层集合预层在给定点处的对象"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指所构造函子的源范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指所构造函子的源范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指由取茎构造得到的函子"}], "notes": []}
