{"unit_id": "tag:007G:prose-0002", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由定义，所有态射（morphisms）<MATH_0001>都是范畴（category）<MATH_0002>中的态射（morphisms），应用遗忘（forgetful）函子（functor）<MATH_0003>后，就得到底层集合（sets）层（sheaf）的相应映射（maps）。照例，我们不区分<MATH_0004>中的态射（morphism）与底层的集合（sets）映射（map），这是因为<MATH_0005>是忠实的（faithful）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n此引理特别适用于：<TEXTITOPEN_0001>取值为不必是阿贝尔（abelian）的群（groups）、环（rings）、固定环（ring）上的模（modules）或固定域（field）上的向量空间（vector spaces）的预层（Presheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "forgetful", "target_term": "遗忘"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指构造中由记号指明的全部态射"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "指这些态射所在的范畴"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "说明由记号指明的对象是该范畴中的态射"}, {"source_term": "forgetful", "target_term": "遗忘", "context": "描述给出底层映射的函子"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "指应用于这些态射的遗忘函子"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指底层层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指遗忘代数结构后所考虑的底层层"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指这些态射遗忘结构后对应的映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指与底层映射等同记写的范畴态射"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指底层映射两端的对象类型"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指用来等同记写态射的底层映射"}, {"source_term": "faithful", "target_term": "忠实的", "context": "指出允许上述记写方式的函子性质"}, {"source_term": "abelian", "target_term": "阿贝尔", "context": "指所考虑的群无须具备的性质"}, {"source_term": "groups", "target_term": "群", "context": "指引理适用的第一类预层的取值"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "指引理适用的一类预层的取值"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "指模所取的固定标量环"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指固定标量环上的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指向量空间所取的固定标量域"}, {"source_term": "vector spaces", "target_term": "向量空间", "context": "指固定标量域上的代数对象"}, {"source_term": "Presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指出列举的代数结构是哪些对象的取值"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:007I:title", "translation": "模（modules）的预层（presheaves）的茎（Stalks）", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "Stalks", "target_term": "茎"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指本节预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaves", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指本节用以取茎的对象"}, {"source_term": "Stalks", "target_term": "茎", "context": "指本节讨论的构造结果"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:007J:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个拓扑空间（topological space）。设<MATH_0002>是一个环（rings）的预层（presheaf），定义在<MATH_0003>上。设<MATH_0004>是一个<MATH_0005>-模（modules）的预层（presheaf）。设<MATH_0006>。典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0007>来自乘法映射（multiplication map）<MATH_0008>，它定义了<MATH_0009>-模（module）结构，所赋予的对象是阿贝尔群（abelian group）<MATH_0010>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "multiplication map", "target_term": "乘法映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "指引理中两个预层的底空间"}, {"source_term": "rings", "target_term": "环", "context": "指标量预层的取值类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指用于定义模结构的标量预层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "指第二个预层所带的结构类型"}, {"source_term": "presheaf", "target_term": "预层", "context": "指用来取茎以得到模的预层"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "指用来定义茎上模结构的映射"}, {"source_term": "multiplication map", "target_term": "乘法映射", "context": "指给出典范映射的原有映射"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指典范映射定义的结构"}, {"source_term": "abelian group", "target_term": "阿贝尔群", "context": "指其上定义模结构的底层阿贝尔群"}], "notes": []}
